# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 ("Binding groups and cycles": the order of a group's lines decides positions and nothing else; a building `match`'s arm adds no path segment) and ruling TC (places counted as built): loud gives 10, so the upper `match` takes `nil` and builds 0 and 1, the lower arm's label is 2 and the last label 3; soft gives 20, so the upper `match` builds 0, the lower arm nothing, and the last label is 1.
